# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PRIVACY FIRST
# This repository is public and must only ever contain synthetic data.
# The rules below exist to stop original (confidential) files being
# committed by accident. Do not remove them without a privacy review.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Local-only folder for anything original/confidential (e.g. the original
# PBIX or source exports used as a reference). Never committed.
private/
original/

# Power BI files can embed a full cached copy of the data they were last
# refreshed against. Blocked by default. The synthetic portfolio PBIX may be
# published later as a deliberate, reviewed exception (git add -f).
*.pbix
*.pbit
# PBIP projects are folders of plain-text model/report metadata, and the
# .pbi/ subfolder holds a local data cache (cache.abf). Same rule: blocked
# by default; the synthetic PBIP can be force-added after a privacy review.
*.pbip
*.SemanticModel/
*.Report/
.pbi/
*.abf
# Zipped exports/archives of models or source material
*.zip

# Private coordination documents (BI audit notes, handoffs, scope drafts).
# These may reference the original project and are not public-safe.
# A document is published only after review, by moving its cleared content
# into docs/ under a normal name.
*_PRIVATE.*
*HANDOFF*.md
CLAUDE_CODE_*.md
PHASE_*.md
ORIGINAL_*.md
*_SCOPE_V*.md

# Secrets and local configuration. Commit a .env.example instead.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Database files and backups (SQL Server / SQLite / Mongo dumps)
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.bak
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
dump/
*.bson

# Pipeline logs can echo row-level data or connection details
logs/
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors / OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
~$*
